{"seq":2,"slug":"inflation-faucet-sink","title":"通货膨胀与水龙头水槽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/economy/inflation-faucet-sink","wordCount":1374,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"通货膨胀与水龙头水槽\">通货膨胀与水龙头水槽</h1><p>一款运营三年的 MMO，新手卖一只兔子皮换来的金币，可能连最便宜的药水都买不起——这就是通货膨胀在游戏里的真实模样。金币不断从「水龙头」涌入经济，若没有足够的「水槽」排出，总量膨胀、币值缩水，最终把新玩家挡在门外。本篇专讲水龙头/水槽模型、通胀的成因与治理。资源的分类与货币层级见 <a href=\"../foundations/resources-currency\">资源与货币</a>，产出循环的结构见 <a href=\"economic-loops\">游戏内经济循环</a>，玩家间交易如何放大或缓冲通胀归 <a href=\"trading-markets\">交易与市场</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>整个货币经济可以抽象成一个水池：水龙头（faucet）是货币进入经济的所有渠道（掉落、任务奖励、每日登录），水槽（sink）是货币离开经济的所有渠道（商店购买、修理费、交易税、消耗品）。池子的水位变化由两者之差决定，通胀就是水位长期上涨。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[水龙头 Faucet] --&gt; B[怪物掉落]&#10;  A --&gt; C[任务/日常奖励]&#10;  A --&gt; D[登录/活动赠送]&#10;  B --&gt; E[货币池/总流通量]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[水槽 Sink]&#10;  F --&gt; G[商店/升级花费]&#10;  F --&gt; H[修理/手续费]&#10;  F --&gt; I[交易税/拍卖抽成]&#10;  F --&gt; J[消耗品/损耗]&#10;  E --&gt; K{水位:产出&gt;消耗?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[通货膨胀]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[通货紧缩]\">flowchart TD\n  A[水龙头 Faucet] --&gt; B[怪物掉落]\n  A --&gt; C[任务/日常奖励]\n  A --&gt; D[登录/活动赠送]\n  B --&gt; E[货币池/总流通量]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[水槽 Sink]\n  F --&gt; G[商店/升级花费]\n  F --&gt; H[修理/手续费]\n  F --&gt; I[交易税/拍卖抽成]\n  F --&gt; J[消耗品/损耗]\n  E --&gt; K{水位:产出&gt;消耗?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[通货膨胀]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[通货紧缩]</pre><p>下表对比典型水龙头与水槽的强度特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>强度可控性</th>\n<th>玩家感受</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>水龙头</td>\n<td>怪物掉金、日常奖励</td>\n<td>高（直接配产出）</td>\n<td>给予感、爽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水龙头</td>\n<td>活动大放送</td>\n<td>中（节点性）</td>\n<td>狂欢、易后遗症</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水槽</td>\n<td>修理/损耗</td>\n<td>高（被动扣除）</td>\n<td>隐形、低反感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水槽</td>\n<td>拍卖抽成 5%–15%</td>\n<td>高（按交易额）</td>\n<td>接受度高、规模大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水槽</td>\n<td>高级养成花费</td>\n<td>高（成本曲线）</td>\n<td>主动、目标导向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"通胀的成因与度量\">通胀的成因与度量</h2><p>游戏通胀的根因是「水龙头长期快过水槽」。每个新玩家都是净产出者（产出多、消耗少），老玩家逐渐变成囤积者，活动又周期性放水——这些都推高总流通量。通胀的直接表现是物价上涨：同样一件道具，要价的金币数逐月攀升。</p>\n<p>度量通胀要看两类指标。宏观看「货币总流通量」与「人均持有量」的增长率；微观看「核心商品篮子价格指数」——选一组代表性道具，跟踪它们的均价随时间变化。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 月篮子均价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，月通胀率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_t = \\frac{p_t - p_{t-1}}{p_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1547em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>健康的长线经济允许温和通胀（给老玩家的财富以意义），但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 长期高企就会形成新手壁垒。这些指标的采集依赖埋点回流，具体口径见 <a href=\"../tuning/data-driven-tuning\">数据驱动调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"水槽设计的艺术\">水槽设计的艺术</h2><p>加水槽比关水龙头更优雅——关水龙头（降掉落）让玩家直接感到「变穷了」，反感强烈；加水槽往往是隐形的、甚至带来价值感。设计水槽有几条经验：</p>\n<p>被动水槽最无痛。装备损耗、修理费、随时间衰减的 buff，这些「自动扣除」的消耗玩家几乎无感，却能稳定回收货币。交易抽成是规模最大的水槽之一——拍卖行抽 5%–15% 手续费，能从高频交易中回收巨量货币，且玩家普遍接受。主动水槽要有吸引力。让玩家「心甘情愿花钱」的水槽（外观、高级养成、抽奖）比强制扣费体验更好，关键是给花费一个值得的目标。</p>\n<p>水槽的强度要与水龙头匹配并留余量。一个粗略的设计目标是让稳态下的回收率略高于产出率，使总量缓慢可控，而非放任膨胀。下表给出一个示意的产出—回收平衡预算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>月均人均金币流量</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>怪物/任务产出</td>\n<td>+120000</td>\n<td>水龙头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动赠送</td>\n<td>+30000</td>\n<td>水龙头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级/养成花费</td>\n<td>-90000</td>\n<td>水槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修理/损耗</td>\n<td>-25000</td>\n<td>水槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易抽成</td>\n<td>-40000</td>\n<td>水槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净额</td>\n<td>-5000</td>\n<td>缓慢回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"治理失控通胀\">治理失控通胀</h2><p>当通胀已经失控（物价飞涨、新手绝望），治理手段从温和到激烈分几档。温和档：上线新的高价值水槽（限定外观、高级强化），靠玩家自愿消费抽干过剩货币；强化既有水槽（提高高端养成成本、调高交易税）。中等档：对产出设软上限（每日金币产出封顶、超额递减），从源头收水龙头。</p>\n<p>激烈档涉及「货币重置」类操作，风险极高。包括等级压缩配套的数值复位（见 <a href=\"../foundations/number-systems-curves\">数值体系与成长曲线</a>）、引入新货币层级把旧货币边缘化、或在极端情况下的经济 wipe。这些手段会冲击玩家既有财富，必须极其谨慎，往往配合补偿。无论用哪一档，治理前都应在 <a href=\"../tuning/simulation-modeling\">数值仿真与建模</a> 里跑模拟预演影响，避免「治通胀反而引发恐慌」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>货币经济是一个水池：水龙头（掉落/奖励/赠送）注入、水槽（购买/损耗/交易税）排出，水位长涨即通胀。</li>\n<li>通胀根因是水龙头长期快过水槽（新手净产出、老手囤积、活动放水），用流通量增长率与商品篮子价格指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 度量。</li>\n<li>加水槽优于关水龙头：被动水槽（损耗/修理）无痛、交易抽成（5%–15%）规模最大、主动水槽要给值得的目标。</li>\n<li>水槽强度应与水龙头匹配并留余量，使稳态回收率略高于产出率，让总量缓慢可控。</li>\n<li>治理失控通胀分温和（加/强化水槽）、中等（产出软上限）、激烈（货币重置/等级压缩）三档，激烈手段须仿真预演并配补偿。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通货膨胀与水龙头水槽","id":"通货膨胀与水龙头水槽"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"通胀的成因与度量","id":"通胀的成因与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"水槽设计的艺术","id":"水槽设计的艺术"},{"level":2,"text":"治理失控通胀","id":"治理失控通胀"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏内经济循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/economy/economic-loops"},"next":{"title":"交易与市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/economy/trading-markets"}}